영어초록:
In this article, We try to analysis the virtue theory of Jeong yak-yong(Da san). Especially We concentrate on the ethical characteristics in the practical problem of virtue. Da san stands on the view point which the virtue is not substance of mind, but the practical veins. Da san asserts that the thought of neo-confucianist on the innate virtue contain many serious problems. Da san criticize that the neo-confucianist define human as a non self-regulation being.
The ethical characteristics of Da san's virtue theory is as follows ; 
First, the virtue - which is benevolence, righteousness, propriety, wisdom and sincerity - is the concept of practice. Second, the practical way of virtue is concern & charity. Third. the virtue is concerned ethics. Fourth, the virtue is self- regulation ethics.
